    "analysis": {
      "investment_rationale": [
        {
          "institution": "Cornerstone VC",
          "speaker": "Wilfred",
          "speaker_role": "Cornerstone VC投资人",
          "rationale": "AI将重塑全球能力评估方式，赢家将是赢得颁证机构和监管机构信任的公司；Sainaptic团队具备稀缺的教学与AI专长，且在教育和考试机构中已有需求验证；其领域特定模型、可解释性和人类专家始终在环的方法使其脱颖而出。",
          "quote": "AI is about to reshape how the world assesses competence, and the winners will be the companies that earn the trust of awarding bodies and regulators. Rajeshwari and Kavitha bring rare pedagogical and AI expertise, and their traction with education providers and examining boards shows the demand is already here. Much of the global workforce must pass exams to qualify for the work they do, and marking and moderation at that scale is a growing challenge. What set Sainaptic apart for us was their approach: domain-specific models, explainability at the core and human experts always in control. That's why we're proud to back them as they scale.",
          "evidence_refs": [
            {
              "source_id": "FISRC-7226731da5c58a45",
              "quote": "AI is about to reshape how the world assesses competence, and the winners will be the companies that earn the trust of awarding bodies and regulators. Rajeshwari and Kavitha bring rare pedagogical and AI expertise, and their traction with education providers and examining boards shows the demand is already here. Much of the global workforce must pass exams to qualify for the work they do, and marking and moderation at that scale is a growing challenge. What set Sainaptic apart for us was their approach: domain-specific models, explainability at the core and human experts always in control. That's why we're proud to back them as they scale.",
              "source_content_hash": "7441170b4d8e2e09",
              "quote_hash": "947cb2e36d063d6816f99024613d3b5dba578faaa1f8b2dd6b397f0950b805b8"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "capital_judgment": "本轮资本押注的核心变量是：AI辅助评分能否在职业与专业资格评估这一高信任门槛场景中，以领域特定模型、可解释性和人类专家在环的方式，赢得颁证机构与监管机构的信任并实现规模化。已验证信号包括：公司披露其领域训练模型将部分资格评分时间从45分钟缩短至8秒，与专家评估者偏差低于1%；官网展示98.9%准确率、98%反馈一致性和1,000+小时节省；并已与Skilltech Solutions达成合作，将技术提供给英国部分大型学徒评估组织。证据边界：上述效率与准确率数据来自公司自述或官网展示，尚未经独立第三方验证；与Skilltech的联合产品预计2027年第一季度推出，尚未产生收入。",
      "validated_signals": [
        "公司披露其领域训练AI模型将部分资格评分时间从45分钟缩短至8秒",
        "公司报告与专家评估者偏差低于1%",
        "官网展示98.9%准确率、98%反馈一致性和1,000+小时节省",
        "与Skilltech Solutions达成合作，将技术提供给英国部分大型学徒评估组织"
      ],
      "risks": [
